{title: Guard What Is Entrusted}
{subtitle: 2 Timothy 1:12}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | ×10

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]I suffer [Dm]as I [Bb]do
[C]For the truth [Dm]I hold so [Bb]true
Not [C]ashamed [Dm]in [Bb]this trial
[C]My spirit [Dm]stands firm and still
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I [C]know the one [Bb]I trust
He will [C]hold [Dm]the sacred [F]dust
Guard what was [C]given [Bb]to me
[C]Until the [Dm]day we see
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
I [C]know the one [Dm]I [Bb]trust
He will [C]hold the sa[Dm]cred dust
Guard [Bb]what was [C]given [Dm]to [Bb]me
Until [C]the day we [Dm]see
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I know the one I [C]trust
He will [Bb]hold the sacred [C]dust
[Dm]Guard what [F]was given to [C]me
[Bb]Until [C]the day we [Dm]see
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]I am con[C]vinced in my [Dm]heart
[Bb]That God will [C]keep my [Dm]part
[Bb]Until that [C]final [Dm]day
