{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Not as[C]hamed in the [Dm]pain
For I know the [C]Lord a[Dm]gain
He [Bb]guards what [C]I hold [Dm]dear
Un[Bb]til the [C]time is [Dm]near
